[{"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:40:23Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "This Q is coming from a strong personal opinion", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:42:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Is X Wahabism and Y Puritanism within Christianity (Z)?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:42:53Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "No", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:43:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Swastik?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:43:34Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "X has nothing to do with the Middle East", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:43:39Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "No", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:43:53Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "is X a religion or a sect within a religion?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:43:57Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "X and Y are places", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:44:13Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Z is a category of religions", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:44:51Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "X=Bihar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:44:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Z=Sramana", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:44:59Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Y=Varanasi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:45:01Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Z is Dharmic?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:45:11Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Y?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:45:13Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Y jerusalem?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:46:25Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "I really think that Bihar can be promoted as an Indian/Dharmic equivalent to Jerusalem. It holds an important place in all four of the major Dharmic/Indian religions", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:46:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Varanasi ends up stealing the spotlight", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:47:23Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "but Bihar would be the equivalent of the “Holy Land” for Abrahamic religions", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:47:51Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "But Varanasi is not important to Hinduism, Jainism, Buddhism, and Sikhism simultaneously", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:48:12Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "it is one of the 4 most important places for Buddhism", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:48:13Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Not at the level atleast", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:48:26Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "and has associations with Mahavira as well", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:48:46Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "birthplace of 4 tirthankaras", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:50:14Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "and has important associations for Sikhism as well… but that’s because it was seen generally as a holy city by Indians so Guru Nanak and others it and the community built gurudwaras there.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:51:11Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Varanasi is comparable to Jerusalem — one city with so much religious history. Bihar to the general region that Abrahamic faiths call the Holy Land", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:51:13Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Yes but Bihar is where the Buddha attained enlightenment and where Mahavira was born. It also has the most sacred site for Sikhs outside of the Punjab region. Plus, an important sphere wrt Krishna worship ‎", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:51:43Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "So overall, I'd say that Bihar triumphs it", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:52:07Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Either way, I really don't have a problem with both UP/Varanasi and Bihar being promoted ofc ‎", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:52:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "don’t disagree about the importance of Bihar. just saying that there is a reason Varanasi gets more of the “spiritual tourism” market", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:52:36Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Yeah but Varanasi already has that reputation to some degree", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:52:53Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "So does UP overall", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:53:08Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "But Bihar, proportionally speaking, doesn't have that", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:53:20Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "But like I said ‎", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:53:24Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "@⁨~Smit D Mahajani⁩ daal do Modiji ko letter. We all will sign it 😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:53:25Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "This", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:53:56Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Bhai agar main PM bana toh sach mein itna promote karunga isko lekar, even UP ko lekar", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:54:18Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "I don't like the negative stereotypes associated with these places. Or with any place for that matter", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:54:27Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Bann jao. Debate toh acha kar hi lete ho 😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:54:47Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Ye backhanded compliment hi 